{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-43554","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49197","text":"--- name: workflows description: Use when the user asks \"how do I use graphonomous for X?\", wants end-to-end recipes, or needs guidance on common multi-step patterns like cold start, codebase exploration, debugging, or autonomous iteration. argument-hint: [cold-start|warm-resume|question|explore|debug|ralph-loop|contradictions|maintenance|end-session|teach|handoff] ---"}]},{"id":"blk-43555","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49198","text":"Graphonomous Workflows"}]},{"id":"blk-43556","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49199","text":"End-to-end recipes for common tasks. Pick the workflow that matches your situation."}]},{"id":"blk-43557","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49200","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-43558","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49201","text":"Workflow type: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-43559","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49202","text":"Cold Start (empty graph)"}]},{"id":"blk-43560","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49203","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49204","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"project overview\")"},{"id":"spn-49205","text":" — confirm empty 2. "},{"id":"spn-49206","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Orient on project\", \"horizon\": \"short\"})"},{"id":"spn-49207","text":" 3. Explore code/docs → "},{"id":"spn-49208","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49209","text":" for each key finding 4. Link nodes with "},{"id":"spn-49210","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49211","text":" where relationships improve retrieval 5. "},{"id":"spn-49212","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", goal_id: \"<id>\", progress: 0.5)"},{"id":"spn-49213","text":" 6. "},{"id":"spn-49214","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"}]},{"id":"blk-43561","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49215","text":"Warm Resume (existing knowledge)"}]},{"id":"blk-43562","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49216","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49217","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\", filters: {\"status\": \"active\"})"},{"id":"spn-49218","text":" 2. "},{"id":"spn-49219","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"attention_survey\", include_idle: false)"},{"id":"spn-49220","text":" 3. Pick top attention item or follow user request 4. "},{"id":"spn-49221","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"<current topic>\")"},{"id":"spn-49222","text":" 5. Continue working with context, saving "},{"id":"spn-49223","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"}]},{"id":"blk-43563","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49224","text":"Answer a Question"}]},{"id":"blk-43564","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49225","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49226","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"<the question>\")"},{"id":"spn-49227","text":" — save "},{"id":"spn-49228","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-49229","text":" 2. Check "},{"id":"spn-49230","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.routing"},{"id":"spn-49231","text":" — if "},{"id":"spn-49232","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-49233","text":", run "},{"id":"spn-49234","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-49235","text":" 3. Optionally "},{"id":"spn-49236","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"coverage\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-49237","text":" for quick act/learn/escalate pre-check 4. Answer using retrieved knowledge + current conversation 5. "},{"id":"spn-49238","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", node_type: \"semantic\", content: \"...\", source: \"conversation\")"},{"id":"spn-49239","text":" 6. If user confirms → "},{"id":"spn-49240","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"success\", causal_node_ids: [...])"}]},{"id":"blk-43565","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49241","text":"Explore a Codebase"}]},{"id":"blk-43566","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49242","text":"1. Create parent goal: "},{"id":"spn-49243","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Explore <repo>\"})"},{"id":"spn-49244","text":" 2. Create sub-goals per module (3–6), each with "},{"id":"spn-49245","marks":["code"],"text":"parent_goal_id"},{"id":"spn-49246","text":" 3. For each module: explore → "},{"id":"spn-49247","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49248","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-49249","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49250","text":" 4. Use "},{"id":"spn-49251","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"traverse\", start_node_id: \"<id>\", max_depth: 2)"},{"id":"spn-49252","text":" to walk related knowledge 5. "},{"id":"spn-49253","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"link_nodes\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49254","text":" — link findings to sub-goals 6. "},{"id":"spn-49255","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49256","text":" after each module 7. "},{"id":"spn-49257","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49258","text":" on parent when all sub-goals done"}]},{"id":"blk-43567","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49259","text":"Debug a Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-43568","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49260","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49261","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", query: \"prior context on <issue>\")"},{"id":"spn-49262","text":" — save "},{"id":"spn-49263","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-49264","text":" 2. Isolate the issue using retrieved context 3. Test fix 4. "},{"id":"spn-49265","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", node_type: \"episodic\", content: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-49266","text":" 5. "},{"id":"spn-49267","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"success\"|\"failure\", causal_node_ids: [...])"},{"id":"spn-49268","text":" with real IDs 6. Link to goal if applicable"}]},{"id":"blk-43569","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49269","text":"Resolve Contradictions"}]},{"id":"blk-43570","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49270","text":"1. Detect: "},{"id":"spn-49271","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-49272","text":" returns nodes with "},{"id":"spn-49273","marks":["code"],"text":"contradicts"},{"id":"spn-49274","text":" edges, or "},{"id":"spn-49275","marks":["code"],"text":"routing: \"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-49276","text":" 2. Diagnose: "},{"id":"spn-49277","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"<topic>\")"},{"id":"spn-49278","text":" — examine SCCs and fault-line edges 3. Deliberate: "},{"id":"spn-49279","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"<the contradiction>\", write_back: true)"},{"id":"spn-49280","text":" 4. Verify: "},{"id":"spn-49281","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49282","text":" again — confirm κ decreased 5. Store resolution as semantic node if not already written back"}]},{"id":"blk-43571","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49283","text":"Ralph Loop (autonomous iteration)"}]},{"id":"blk-43572","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49284","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49285","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"attention_survey\")"},{"id":"spn-49286","text":" → pick top item 2. "},{"id":"spn-49287","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49288","text":" for that goal — save "},{"id":"spn-49289","marks":["code"],"text":"causal_context"},{"id":"spn-49290","text":" 3. Act on it 4. "},{"id":"spn-49291","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49292","text":" with real causal IDs 5. "},{"id":"spn-49293","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49294","text":" → follow act/learn/escalate decision 6. Advance to next attention item 7. Repeat; "},{"id":"spn-49295","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"},{"id":"spn-49296","text":" every 4–5 cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-43573","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49297","text":"Maintenance"}]},{"id":"blk-43574","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49298","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49299","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"stats\")"},{"id":"spn-49300","text":" — check overall graph health 2. "},{"id":"spn-49301","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"},{"id":"spn-49302","text":" 3. "},{"id":"spn-49303","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\")"},{"id":"spn-49304","text":" — review all goals 4. Re-review any active goals near completion thresholds 5. Transition stale goals to "},{"id":"spn-49305","marks":["code"],"text":"suspended"},{"id":"spn-49306","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-49307","marks":["code"],"text":"abandoned"},{"id":"spn-49308","text":" with metadata"}]},{"id":"blk-43575","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49309","text":"Teach a Domain"}]},{"id":"blk-43576","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49310","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49311","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"create_goal\", payload: {\"title\": \"Learn <domain>\"})"},{"id":"spn-49312","text":" 2. User provides info → "},{"id":"spn-49313","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49314","text":" for each fact/procedure 3. "},{"id":"spn-49315","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_edge\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49316","text":" to connect related concepts 4. "},{"id":"spn-49317","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"link_nodes\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49318","text":" — link all nodes to goal 5. Build out recursively until coverage review returns "},{"id":"spn-49319","marks":["code"],"text":"act"}]},{"id":"blk-43577","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49320","text":"Multi-Agent Handoff"}]},{"id":"blk-43578","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49321","text":"1. Prepare state snapshot: "},{"id":"spn-49322","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"list_goals\")"},{"id":"spn-49323","text":" 2. For each active goal: "},{"id":"spn-49324","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"get_goal\", goal_id: \"<id>\")"},{"id":"spn-49325","text":" 3. Include linked nodes, progress, outcomes, and coverage state 4. Recipient resumes with "},{"id":"spn-49326","marks":["code"],"text":"/graphonomous:bootstrap"},{"id":"spn-49327","text":" to load context"}]},{"id":"blk-43579","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49328","text":"End of Session"}]},{"id":"blk-43580","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49329","text":"1. Store pending knowledge: "},{"id":"spn-49330","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"store_node\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49331","text":" 2. Report outcomes: "},{"id":"spn-49332","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49333","text":" 3. Update goal progress: "},{"id":"spn-49334","marks":["code"],"text":"act(action: \"manage_goal\", operation: \"set_progress\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49335","text":" 4. Consolidate: "},{"id":"spn-49336","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate(action: \"run\")"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera3i6xbiyvuudiwws5d4da5afxm4f2nbgit7jdzu55u6zup2nlv6fa","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}